{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis with a quadratic-base field and the full rank-three inverse",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 7701 MiB (7.5196 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 44663 million field multiplications (19927 and 24736), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (Ncmp, I3, I6, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, C6, C7, dec_sum_g2) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
